      "html": "<section class=\"ds-collection\"><h3>Résultats</h3><button><span><strong>Une promotion sur la PS5</strong><small>Déjà disponible au démarrage</small><small>Vérifié le 23 oct. 2026 17:05</small></span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 960 960\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M504,480L320,296L376,240L616,480L376,720L320,664L504,480Z\"/></svg></button><button><span><strong>Une autre offre vérifiée</strong><small>Vérifié le 23 oct. 2026 18:05</small></span><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 960 960\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M504,480L320,296L376,240L616,480L376,720L320,664L504,480Z\"/></svg></button></section>",
